Stage A is up as draft PR #10: <https://github.com/rodbegbie/stopwatch-screensaver/pull/10>. It's a draft against `main`, and the linked trail is <https://entire.io/gh/rodbegbie/stopwatch-screensaver/trails/4>.

- **Contents:** the two commits, namely the `-DSTANDALONE` scorer fix with its test and the regenerated assessment.
- **PR body:** the PR was created with a short body, so I set it to the same text as the trail, as `AGENTS.md` says. It has no `Fixes #N` line, because issue #5 is about table sorting and isn't related.
- **Not pushed:** stage B (`feature/xlockmore-framework`) stays local. I'll rebase it onto `main` once you've merged #10.

When you've merged #10, I'll:
- delete the merged branch (remote and local) and fast-forward `main`;
- rebase stage B;
- remove the spec and plan from the branch;
- regenerate the assessment;
- open its draft PR with `entire trail create`.

Bot reviews can lag about 20 minutes. If any findings appear on #10, tell me and I'll address them with `entire trail finding list 4`.

